OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA more
OL,6,Fsettled weekend to come with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine around all the way through
OL,8,Finto Monday. Although chillier nights
OL,9,Fbring a risk of frost and patchy fog.
